#: includes/class-pod-designer-settings.php:579
msgid "WooCommerce is not active, so the designer runs in standalone (shortcode) mode: submitted designs show up under the Designs menu."
msgstr "A WooCommerce nem aktív, ezért a designer önálló (shortcode-os) módban működik: a beküldött designok a Designok menüben jelennek meg."

#: includes/class-pod-designer-woocommerce.php:63
